{
 "note": "Vasse Village by Bunbury Farmers Market, the big single-storey market hall beside Bussell Hwy just west of the Busselton Bypass West Rotary (opened 5 Dec 2024), from docs/landmarks/vasse_farmers_market.md (Landgate aerial, OSM outline, the opening-day photo). A black parapet box with copper-brown capping, base band and pilasters; on the street front a rust-steel relief of an orchard and river, the framed Vasse Village sign standing above the parapet, a screen and a poster. Green roof behind the parapet; shade sails over the alfresco on the left. Metres: x left to right as seen from the street in front (south-west to north-east), y back (north-west) from the front wall.",
